#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:5 d326b8e173b2462782bcda3d8a534887
msgid "SkyRocket with other Ground Stations"
msgstr "SkyRocket与其他地面站"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:7 5f0f20027fa649b0a395a11a19438fb9
msgid ""
"The SkyViper has its own app that runs on android or iOS, but to access the "
"full capabilities of the ArduPilot firmware you may prefer to use another "
"ground station package. The SkyViper can work with any of the "
":ref:`ArduPilot compatible ground stations <common-choosing-a-ground-"
"station>` including :ref:`Mission Planner <planner:install-mission-"
"planner>`.  For any of them:"
msgstr ""
"SkyViper有自己的Android或iOS应用程序，但要使用ArduPilot固件的全部功能，您可能更喜欢使用其他地面站软件。SkyViper可与任何"
" :ref:`ArduPilot兼容地面站 <common-choosing-a-ground-station>` 配合使用，包括 "
":ref:`Mission Planner <planner:install-mission-planner>`。对于其中任何一款："

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:9 74dd1d676c0c4c5b8b77f9c1b5df61a0
msgid "connect your PC/tablet/phone to the drone's wifi access point"
msgstr "将您的PC/平板/手机连接到飞行器的WiFi接入点"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:10 cdbea3d8774b402695439bd5ae8d3841
msgid ""
"on the ground station set the connection type to \"UDP\" and press connect."
"  If asked, set the port to \"14550\""
msgstr "在地面站上将连接类型设置为\"UDP\"并按连接。如果询问，将端口设置为\"14550\""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:15 6bab81e554394b298d24650323f9d88e
msgid ""
"If using Mission Planner, the video from the SkyViper can be made to appear "
"in the “HUD” (the Heads Up Display which normally shows the blue and green "
"attitude display) The SkyViper uses UDP broadcasts you can connect from "
"multiple devices at once. Use the following setup sequence:"
msgstr ""
"如果使用 Mission "
"Planner，可以让SkyViper的视频显示在\"HUD\"（平视显示器，通常显示蓝绿色姿态显示）中。SkyViper使用UDP广播，您可以同时从多个设备连接。请使用以下设置步骤："

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:17 108a2bbafc98437098a006553384fb9f
msgid ""
"Install the gstreamer 1.0-x86_64-1.9.2.msi package from "
"[here](https://gstreamer.freedesktop.org/data/pkg/windows/1.9.2/)"
msgstr ""
"从[此处](https://gstreamer.freedesktop.org/data/pkg/windows/1.9.2/)安装gstreamer "
"1.0-x86_64-1.9.2.msi包"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:18 63f3d205a0f849e19af519d206bdfaef
msgid ""
"In Mission Planner, right mouse click on the HUD and select \"Video\" then "
"\"Set GStreamer Source\"."
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 中，在HUD上右击，选择\"Video\"，然后选择\"Set GStreamer Source\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:19 cef4eff503c748ea9baa83bd9fb6552b
msgid "Change the IP setting and port for the SkyViper video in Sonix board."
msgstr "更改Sonix板上SkyViper视频的IP设置和端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:21 2aa1efd1626942d9ac53fe6758f98390
msgid ""
"**Default Setting in MP** rtspsrc location=rtsp://192.168.1.133:8554/video1 "
"! application/x-rtp ! rtpjpegdepay ! videoconvert ! video/x-raw,format=BGRA "
"! appsink name=outsink"
msgstr ""
"**MP默认设置** rtspsrc location=rtsp://192.168.1.133:8554/video1 ! "
"application/x-rtp ! rtpjpegdepay ! videoconvert ! video/x-raw,format=BGRA ! "
"appsink name=outsink"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:24 86f8ff3bad7443138aaa5f597bbf312e
msgid ""
"**Setting for SkyViper Video MP** rtspsrc "
"location=rtsp://192.168.99.1:5600/video1 ! application/x-rtp ! rtpjpegdepay "
"! videoconvert ! video/x-raw,format=BGRA ! appsink name=outsink"
msgstr ""
"**SkyViper视频MP设置** rtspsrc location=rtsp://192.168.99.1:5600/video1 ! "
"application/x-rtp ! rtpjpegdepay ! videoconvert ! video/x-raw,format=BGRA ! "
"appsink name=outsink"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:27 76b035e3471f4bcdb4f6e80c1e03a5fe
msgid ""
"Launch Mission Planner after the SkyViper has been powered up and the laptop"
" WiFi has been connected to the drone’s wifi access point."
msgstr "SkyViper启动且笔记本电脑WiFi已连接到飞行器WiFi接入点后，启动 Mission Planner。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:31 3907e1f68a82424cbd90016834cf9ed6
msgid ""
"The SkyViper uses MAVLink2 by default, which does not work with some older "
"GCS software (such as Tower) that only use MAVLink1. To use these older GCSs"
" you may need to change the :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` "
"parameter to 1 from the default of 2."
msgstr ""
"SkyViper默认使用MAVLink2，这与某些只使用MAVLink1的老版地面站软件（如Tower）不兼容。要使用这些较旧的地面站，您可能需要将 "
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` 参数从默认值2更改为1。"
